-- The definition half of the cross-IMPORT pair. See
-- ok/section-given-import-call.l4, which imports this file.
--
-- A section GIVEN, and a rule that reads it. Discharge runs per module, so this
-- rule gains a trailing input for `the rate` when THIS file is discharged --
-- while an importer's call site was checked against the arity written here.

§ `Rates`
    GIVEN `the rate` IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 0.05

@export
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`tax on` amount MEANS amount TIMES `the rate`

#EVAL `tax on` 100
#ASSERT (`tax on` 100) EQUALS 5
